---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ArticleSchema from "../../components/ArticleSchema.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../../components/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";
import Button from "../../components/ui/Button.astro";

const title = "Local SEO Checklist: How to Dominate Local Search Results in 2026";
const description = "A comprehensive local SEO checklist to dominate local search results. Covering Google Business Profile, citations, reviews, and local content strategy.";
const date = "2026-06-10";
---

<BaseLayout title={`${title} | Laravel Seo`} description={description}>
  <ArticleSchema {title} {description} date={date} />
  <BreadcrumbSchema items={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Blog", href: "/blog" },
    { name: title, href: "/blog/local-seo-checklist-dominate-local-search" },
  ]} />

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-violet-400">Local SEO</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">12 min read</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">{title}</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
        <span>Published: {date}</span>
        <span>Tags: local seo, seo checklist, local search, google business profile</span>
      </div>
    </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Dominating local search results requires a systematic approach. This comprehensive <strong>local SEO checklist</strong> covers everything you need to do to rank higher in local search, attract more customers, and grow your business. Follow these steps in order for the best results.
      </p>

      <h2>Phase 1: Google Business Profile Optimization</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Claim and verify your Google Business Profile</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Complete every field with accurate information</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Select the most specific primary category</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Add 5+ relevant secondary categories</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Write a keyword-optimized business description</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Upload 10+ high-quality photos</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Set accurate business hours including holidays</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Add relevant attributes (free Wi-Fi, wheelchair accessible, etc.)</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Enable messaging and Q&A</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create your first Google Post</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 2: Local Citation Building</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Audit existing citations for NAP consistency</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create listings on top directories (Yelp, Bing Places, Apple Maps)</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Submit to industry-specific directories</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Join your local Chamber of Commerce</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Ensure NAP consistency across all platforms</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Set up citation monitoring</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 3: Review Management</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create a review generation strategy</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Respond to all existing reviews</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Set up review monitoring alerts</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Implement a post-purchase review request process</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Monitor and respond to competitor reviews</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 4: On-Page Local SEO</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Add location pages to your website</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Include NAP in website footer and contact page</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Implement local business schema markup</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create location-specific landing pages</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Optimize title tags with location keywords</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Add embedded Google Map to contact page</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 5: Local Content Strategy</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create blog posts about local events and news</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Develop location-specific service pages</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Produce local guides and resources</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Partner with local influencers for content</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Create video content featuring your location</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 6: Local Link Building</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Sponsor local events and organizations</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Partner with complementary local businesses</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Get listed on local news and community sites</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Participate in local charity initiatives</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Host local workshops or meetups</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Phase 7: Monitoring and Maintenance</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Track local keyword rankings weekly</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Monitor Google Business Profile insights</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Check for new reviews daily</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Audit citations quarterly</li>
        <li><input type="checkbox" disabled /> Run monthly SEO audits using SEO tools</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Conclusion</h2>
      <p>
        Following this <strong>local SEO checklist</strong> systematically will dramatically improve your local search presence. Start with Phase 1 and work your way through each phase. The key to success is consistency and regular maintenance. Use SEO tools to automate monitoring so you can focus on growing your business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <Button href="/blog" variant="outline">Back to Blog</Button>
        <Button href="/software/laravel-seo">Learn About Laravel SEO Package</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
